{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17115","headline":"白露爲霜 · 徐敞","name":"白露爲霜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早寒青女至，零露结爲霜。\n入夜飞清景，凌晨积素光。\n驷星初皙皙，葭菼复苍苍。\n色冒沙滩白，威加木叶黄。\n鲜辉袭纨扇，杀气掩干将。\n葛屦那堪履，徒令君子伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐敞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}